<title>USA: Finish Line closes on $22.50/shr offering.</title>
<headline>Finish Line closes on $22.50/shr offering.</headline>
<dateline>INDIANAPOLLIS, Ind. 1996-12-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Finish Line Inc said Wednesday a public offering of 3.0 million of the company's Class A common shares closed at $22.50 per share.</p>
<p>Of the shares sold, 2.4 million were sold by the specialty retailer and 600,000 by certain selling stockholders of the company.</p>
<p>The offering was made through an underwriting group managed by Smith Barney Inc, A.G. Edwards &amp; Sons Inc and Oppenheimer &amp; Co Inc.</p>
<p>		  ((-- Chicago newsdesk 312 408-8787))</p>
</text>
